Error [E1270]: adapter package declaration is not complete
 Why: `Pkg.adapt` needs `name:`, `source:`, and a supported `recipe:`; recipes are `Recipe.copy()`, `Recipe.prebuilt(bin:, as:)`, or a finite `Recipe.build(steps: […])`.
 Fix: write `Pkg.adapt(name: "tool", source: "./vendor/tool", recipe: Recipe.copy())`.
